WEBVTT

00:01:56.487 --> 00:02:00.533
my parents realized
that was no longer an option.

00:02:00.575 --> 00:02:03.953
So after four years of living in exile,

00:02:03.995 --> 00:02:07.707
we sought asylum in the UK
and began a new life.

00:02:08.624 --> 00:02:10.334
I started going to school.

00:02:11.335 --> 00:02:15.631
And almost 25 years later,
I'm standing here with you.

00:02:16.299 --> 00:02:21.304
I'm now working to help others
overcome devastation by war.

00:02:21.762 --> 00:02:26.142
To overcome the trauma
of being expendable.

00:02:27.101 --> 00:02:28.269
In my work,

00:02:28.311 --> 00:02:33.566
I see how living under constant
threat of violence and feeling unsafe